{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "40f10bd5858f395f8106c088dca6e8790dda6550fc4667e31dc7fe1aa270d205", "ja": "情熱のはじまり", "zh": "热情的开端", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fba1ef9508c2fe0def2140a3fec090d484f9b8e7db7dbb87d21f73e30db9019e", "ja": "熱きフラメンコユニット『chicAAmor』\nが始動！　メンバーの紗代子、風花、千鶴、\nジュリアは、気合い十分な様子。4人の情熱\n的な挑戦が、いよいよ幕を開けた。", "zh": "热情洋溢的弗拉门戈组合『chicAAmor』\n启动！成员纱代子、风花、千鹤、\n茱莉亚看起来也都干劲十足。4人的热情挑战，终于拉开了序幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3d202a0fc397853a4887bb4d4b9b6953469f1ba9477015ade6c6645c6265ccc0", "ja": "（昨夜のうちに、ユニットメンバーには連絡済み。\n打ち合わせが楽しみだな……！）", "zh": "（昨晚已经联系过组合成员了。真期待接下来的碰面会啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6ffcf3788e61871b4c072b22001e056b79080f197d18277e20c71788ff9610c0", "ja": "フラメンコの「オーレ！」って、いいぞ、\nお見事っていう意味なんだぁ。ふむふむ……。", "zh": "弗拉门戈里的“欧雷”，是“真棒”“干得漂亮”的意思啊。嗯嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "11ad4cda4e0795c02e96e67cced1dff917573de72da113b15f0034a733f8999e", "ja": "あら、おはよう風花。まだ集合時間前ですのに……\n気合いが入っていますのね♪", "zh": "哎呀，早上好，风花。明明还没到集合时间……\n你已经干劲十足了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f9c566b65b3759fb0125f0ae70933eb9059e250e2a4b4f8d394dd52efd4bd338", "ja": "あ、おはよう。それを言うなら千鶴ちゃんもだよ♪\nそれに、私よりも先にふたりが……。", "zh": "啊，早上好。要这么说的话，千鹤也是呀♪\n而且，还有两个人比我先到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "b5957e2882f7af3ad33f6bae1946334602d0fc57f2fcc845658c86a39157e1d8", "ja": "おはようございます、千鶴さん！\nわあ、もう全員揃っちゃった♪", "zh": "早上好，千鹤！\n哇，大家已经全都到齐了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "e64c263e9b387762cc62bec75d872e9f033f1419fe800cd43ebd661ee6341995", "ja": "遠足が楽しみで早起きした子どもみたいだな……。\nま、あたしも人の事言えないけどな♪", "zh": "简直就像因为期待远足而早早起床的孩子一样……。嘛，我也没资格说别人就是了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "37815ec84f49cd9fc095d3ed71d0c8da7ebd0570253bbfb781448ee1f13818d0", "ja": "これはつまり……ふふっ。みんなの心は\n既にひとつ、ということですわね♪", "zh": "也就是说……呵呵。大家已经同心同德了，对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "a3902f328a90686c47155ff236b2edc5b429772669d28496c4f8598da409dc68", "ja": "はい！　やっと4人でスタートできるんです！\n気合いは全員、最初からマックスです！", "zh": "是！终于能和4个人一起开始了！\n大家从一开始就干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "adf0fef2b81bd3f82ec90675f56f684dc17801c91ac98964534c9ee37d3c8bf6", "ja": "曲もフラメンコだし、熱く演れそうじゃないか。\nたまってたもの開放して、目にもの見せてやろうぜ！", "zh": "曲子是弗拉门戈，感觉能演得很燃。\n把憋着的劲儿全放出来，让他们见识见识咱们的厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "0cce55428baaa86357303b6baa9b65f9c210d59ccf816474fbffb38add10d13a", "ja": "もちろん！　でも、フラメンコってスペインの\n音楽だよね……？　ジュリア、スペインに詳しい？", "zh": "那是当然！不过，弗拉门戈是西班牙的\n音乐对吧……？茱莉亚，你了解西班牙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "2a82ae1250b334145b4c6ee87fe6c389a38aa8b7123ad774840651d80e06d009", "ja": "え！？　いや、詳しくはないけど……あ、千鶴は詳しい\nよな？　海外旅行なんて、散歩みたいなモンだろ？", "zh": "诶！？不，我也不是很了解……啊，千鹤不是很了解吗？出国旅行对你来说不就跟散步一样嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1011_038chz", "source_sha256": "244aca7c3267a31b58133fc9bd5fea5ac991241bc0fe91a3546efa50b1118d14", "ja": "ゴフッ！？　そ、そうですわね、何度かショッピング\nに立ち寄った程度ですけども。お、おほほほほ……。", "zh": "咳呃！？这、这倒也是，确实只是去逛过几次街\n而已，不过……呃、呵呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b08dead84badc00949c2210db9299f42752cdc7fe01621b8b0234d4a4bebc1fa", "ja": "さすが千鶴ちゃん！　いいなぁ～。\nやっぱりパエリアとか、本場のは違うの？", "zh": "不愧是千鹤！真好啊～\n果然像海鲜饭之类的，正宗的味道就是不一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "b86d225f2613cfeb97a25a7de53981a11fbf1f7f56d2b10528bded0dc83faaf8", "ja": "え、ええ、なかなかのお味で……あ、イベリコ豚なども\nオススメですのよ。ぜひ召し上がってくださいまし。", "zh": "呃、嗯，味道相当不错……啊，伊比利亚猪肉之类的也很值得推荐。请务必品尝一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1014_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "526c9d595e6087aa4d4774d8e93f85bd324ca9cbdfe21f266bc87e49e88214b9", "ja": "おはよう、だいぶ早いけどもうそろってたのか。\n早速盛り上がってるみたいだな！", "zh": "早上好，虽然还早了点，但大家已经到齐了吗？\n看起来已经热闹起来了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "22a93c29634008f57375b1decf227a151052278e0029a7d2bbe9d66a584eaea3", "ja": "よう、{$P$}。\nちょうど、みんなでスペインのことを話してたんだ。", "zh": "哟，{$P$}。\n我们正好在聊西班牙的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a098fe53ed31c5a73c15d5051d18456c4ebcf6fdafaf6decad15a033ae13a015", "ja": "意気込みは十分って感じだな。よし！　スペインの\nイメージ、どんどん膨らませてみてくれ！", "zh": "看来干劲十足啊。好！尽情丰富一下对西班牙的印象吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a48f7b0f0322976529c49f1d5f8d815fbd9dd53dcfe1bf475f70440926759c2e", "ja": "じゃあ、えっと……アヒージョとか、\nトルティージャとか、ワインとか……♪", "zh": "那、那个……蒜香虾、西班牙土豆煎蛋，还有葡萄酒什么的……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7aa380c04feffa901e03dfa9bb8df7582e664a8403885cb3b681e2b92ab4feec", "ja": "……うん、居酒屋の注文みたいだが、\nどれも美味しくていいよな。他にはどうだ？", "zh": "……嗯，听起来像是在居酒屋点菜，不过这些都很好吃，对吧？还有别的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "d9c8476d4a986c0951ccf72b06d9742d7a9f7c43f64342f1850b895fe6d294ff", "ja": "私は闘牛のイメージです！　前に奈緒ちゃんが闘牛士の\nお仕事してましたよね？　カッコよかったなぁ～♪", "zh": "我想到的是斗牛！之前奈绪不是做过斗牛士的工作吗？特别帅气呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "473d7f68a2b5957cfa6bc6b94c8c2968050934db60418780ca517dac894f1ab8", "ja": "そういやフラメンコギターって、普通のアコギとは\n違うんだよ。そういうのも、なんか面白そうだ♪", "zh": "说起来，弗拉门戈吉他和普通的民谣吉他是不一样的哦。感觉这种差异也挺有意思的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "337746404ca2fa1a60c9ba64f7dec17a9a1bb89b455560b5beb73bae340b72ac", "ja": "スペインといえば情熱の国。自由で奔放で、ロマン\nチックで……まさにフラメンコのイメージですわね。", "zh": "说到西班牙，就是热情之国。自由奔放，又充满浪漫……简直就是弗拉明戈给人的印象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "0964511dfb9f05d10a72a87cdcccc6ca08d4dd97641f2918a1881743d5921c13", "ja": "そっか……今気づきましたけど、よく考えたらそういう\nイメージ、意外と千鶴さんにピッタリな気がします！", "zh": "原来如此……我刚刚才发现，仔细想想，那种形象意外地很适合千鹤小姐呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "b8bff7fc5c75dc429386cf1c0f0e88455cf9b7ae31e81f759acd38d9a78bda49", "ja": "光栄ですわ。ありがとうございま……、あら？\nそういえば……。", "zh": "这是我的荣幸。谢谢您……，咦？  \n说起来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "02c28c400f9f4aa4c5374332aab3450b056278c1fe983bc56f6b8de53e371781", "ja": "紗代子にも、風花にもジュリアにも。\nまさに『意外とピッタリ』じゃありませんこと？", "zh": "纱代子、风花，还有茱莉亚，不正是都意外地很合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f50abcb5e7f391979de0dc4d35e9a1f670a651208d68f93b34446df351338a0a", "ja": "意外とピッタリ？\n……そういわれてみると、そんな気も……？", "zh": "意外地合适？\n……你这么一说，好像确实有点……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1027_050jul", "source_sha256": "4cbc45996a5de53639f8dae566266284f68678067cc9719739727606970a7e40", "ja": "でも、なんでだろうな？　{$P$}、\nこのメンバーでフラメンコってどういう理由なんだ？", "zh": "不过，为什么呢？{$P$}，\n让这几位成员跳弗拉明戈，究竟是出于什么理由？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "74c9d39347a5d2e9ea913b10be3b8995cd4355272443447b1ad92b2f6e127f07", "ja": "えっ。それは……\n意外とピッタリだな、と思って。", "zh": "诶。因为这个……我觉得意外地很合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "ecf764fea5996c158f5dcdeb555a91032089a7047d31f7c2bf8172cc6c03bbb0", "ja": "ってそれだけかよ！　相変わらずテキトーだなぁ。\nま、いいけどさ。", "zh": "就只有这个啊！还是一如既往地随便啊。\n嘛，不过也无所谓啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "4d934b12659b17928df222a5838733872b7d26758ecadd5adbbbb0cbb2416a2b", "ja": "こういうのは直感も大事だから。曲を聞いてみて、\n改めてこのメンバーでよかったと思えたしな。", "zh": "这种事直觉也很重要。听了这首歌之后，我再次觉得，能和这些成员一起真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "4da86be4f2cff462cbbac9a6530c81f2a56295318ebaaa69a2d77fbd8bcc6ead", "ja": "えっ、もう曲あるんですか！？\n聞いてみたいです！", "zh": "诶，已经有歌曲了吗！？\n我想听听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "4e1f0359f5d77c3c75d6015f8be27edc9fc144027857b85e25661bd71a5c7e48", "ja": "よし。それじゃあ、聞いてもらうとするか。\n歌詞はまだないんだけどな。", "zh": "好，那就放给你听听吧。\n不过目前还没有填词就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "3397651bd1dc83fc3c63e529d7f0ed12f561614fc7782647686c58be25a2cf16", "ja": "へぇ、いいじゃないか！　ギターのカッティングが、\nものすごくフラメンコって感じだ！", "zh": "哦，不错嘛！吉他的切音听起来特别有弗拉门戈风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1035_027say", "source_sha256": "be55538ddc6edfa37b22d727358a2967e71f635df30e1b42d5fbc7051a3087a0", "ja": "雰囲気も……なんだか、血がたぎるっていうか……\n体がうずうずしてきます！", "zh": "气氛也……总觉得有种热血沸腾的感觉……\n身体都开始蠢蠢欲动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f3277b4f03d84b38e7e7b9f747cd688f789ae9662c3352a5eb44b02a366ff86d", "ja": "ふふっ、フラメンコなんて習ったことないのに、\n思わずステップ踏みたくなっちゃうね♪", "zh": "呵呵，明明从来没学过弗拉门戈舞，\n却忍不住想踩起舞步来呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "7e1e8304261571c1c679ca15969fd459a64548d8fbdc7cec148a9ed4ab5d7cc4", "ja": "それに、どことなく気品や気高さも感じますわ。\nとても素敵な楽曲ですのね。", "zh": "而且，还隐约能感受到优雅与高贵呢。这真是一首非常棒的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "c68aeb8939786ad2b6acc29419bc00e59ff5caccecd71f79143ae47f5891b3c0", "ja": "気に入ってくれてなによりだよ。待たせてすまなかった\nが、改めて……『chicAAmor』、やってくれるか？", "zh": "你喜欢就好。让你久等了，抱歉。\n不过，再问一次……愿意演唱《chicAAmor》吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1039_038chz", "source_sha256": "2a92dc6546bc1ddc54017b11efb58479fc95f319c2b53131d6bf10afab201a47", "ja": "頼れる仲間と素晴らしい楽曲……。\n断る理由はありませんわよね？", "zh": "有可靠的伙伴，还有精彩的歌曲……没有理由拒绝，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b8c5143ddd66183c75827f0c79be01995d76c6502a4b3e35dde0050f26c7c9d1", "ja": "はい！　今、曲を聞いて感じている気持ちの昂りも、\nステージでしっかり表現したいと思います♪", "zh": "是的！我也想把现在听着歌曲时涌起的激动心情，在舞台上充分表现出来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1041_050jul", "source_sha256": "13a7e3b5d66cb910f6859850d3066e3d56952f6ab395b9ac40e02949c67a4997", "ja": "ふふん、当然だろ？\n最高にロックなフラメンコ、見せてやるぜ！", "zh": "哼哼，这不是当然的吗？\n让你见识一下最摇滚的弗拉明戈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1042_027say", "source_sha256": "34baf503382d24742c312998531aa23fd0566bbf9c57e2d3c8bfcffa27da9023", "ja": "情熱の国の、情熱的な音楽……。\n私も全力の情熱で、やりきってみせます！", "zh": "热情国度的热情音乐……\n我也会全力倾注自己的热情，彻底展现给大家看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "9ee8d13c3d474e91b72ddbf24bc9a5dd70b527f40e5a5d8badce0d67feda50d0", "ja": "（ようやくスタートを切れた。これからも、\nみんなをしっかりサポートしていこう！　オーレ！）", "zh": "（终于迈出了第一步。今后也要继续好好支持大家！欧雷！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
